176} :answer-field/id #uuid "180cfbb0-2978-5516-b5f4-d1f113257b75" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262166}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "389b9b37-1144-5c58-ae9f-0547f80b582d" :question/math-academy-id "q-129144" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a=6b \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b+\\frac{3}{2}=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b=0 \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262954 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "185b4e95-b4a0-5de8-9261-d542718f5c47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260089} {:answer/id #uuid "78034341-3742-5248-aca4-b79ea92704b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260925} {:answer/id #uuid "a173e8eb-2a72-58f0-92da-3bede70514f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261278} {:answer/id #uuid "c9186076-0cb5-5afc-b113-09a238657b5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261653} {:answer/id #uuid "dcde83ec-9e11-55f5-909d-64911ec61004" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & -1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261826}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c9186076-0cb5-5afc-b113-09a238657b5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261653} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a21c1eb-d8fc-5660-80e6-2e379e12ae74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262279}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "1822f3b9-1c46-5159-80d2-c54e1e2abf48" :question/math-academy-id "q-129146" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0=4n-8 \\\\ n=-6m+\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $m,n$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0m-4n=-8 \\\\ 6m+n=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338979 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "295a8105-5ca7-5ca5-bb2d-077d03e93316" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336417} {:answer/id #uuid "29c449bb-9934-5c52-8f09-9d20678309a6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336419} {:answer/id #uuid "56960842-9c7f-5a1b-8950-51ca9b31964e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336828} {:answer/id #uuid "8f449dbb-3b0c-5f6d-b4f6-33394bc3ec89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337325} {:answer/id #uuid "c2f4103e-b187-5e34-b726-4147a875e8a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c2f4103e-b187-5e34-b726-4147a875e8a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337764} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c8669ad-ee61-58fa-a437-6b5d11880ada" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338564}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9dc9c77e-9ffe-58b8-b13b-5afd3da944fe" :question/math-academy-id "q-71731" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338980 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fd75d48-cff0-5586-bb47-37c8b3e82f04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336180} {:answer/id #uuid "18118c2c-b9e9-5fa0-afc7-21691a8a369e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336256} {:answer/id #uuid "1ecea6f3-a5ef-5374-8504-e95aa022ea91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336317} {:answer/id #uuid "bfa318d0-5a4a-5971-ac56-9307bc9fdd64" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}5 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337735} {:answer/id #uuid "e4cea74b-7e56-55c0-9a12-f794e35ffaf7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "18118c2c-b9e9-5fa0-afc7-21691a8a369e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336256} :answer-field/id #uuid "650aaab6-a283-5654-a83d-88825652ae23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338456}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c01a0cd8-7bc8-5a6a-9cd8-989ca542ee1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-71733" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338981 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ddc44f3-1a32-52a9-9031-b6a56a4c5108" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336161} {:answer/id #uuid "0ea49bc6-7ef7-57db-bb92-09c032a1d6f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}-1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336170} {:ans